Description: Shippori Mincho, a Japanese Mincho (serif) typeface
 Shippori Mincho is a Japanese Mincho typeface for books and long texts,
 designed by FONTDASU. It is shipped in five weights: Regular, Medium,
 SemiBold, Bold and ExtraBold.
 .
 The files are those of the Google Fonts repository, unmodified. The font is
 licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.
